          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "Xiahou Dun's younger brother Xiahou Lian had been enfeoffed as a Marquis in his own right.",
            "zht": "夏侯惇的弟弟夏侯廉早已因自身功勞封爲列侯。",
            "zhs": "夏侯惇的弟弟夏侯廉早已因自身功劳封为列侯。"
          }
        }
