    {
      "from": "夏侯惇（元讓）",
      "to": "夏侯佐",
      "type": "kinship",
      "polarity": "neutral",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "Xiahou Zuo, Township Marquis of Gao'an and Xiahou Dun's grandson, died in the second year of Taishi without an heir; Emperor Wu of Jin then ordered a close relative of Dun to continue the line.",
            "zht": "高安鄉侯夏侯佐是夏侯惇之孫，泰始二年去世，沒有後嗣；晉武帝下詔選夏侯惇的近親承襲封爵。",
            "zhs": "高安乡侯夏侯佐是夏侯惇之孙，泰始二年去世，没有后嗣；晋武帝下诏选夏侯惇的近亲承袭封爵。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "夏侯惇（元讓）",
      "to": "夏侯楙（子林）",
      "type": "kinship",
      "polarity": "neutral",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "Xiahou Mao, courtesy name Zilin, was Xiahou Dun's second son, and had been enfeoffed as a Marquis in his own right.",
            "zht": "夏侯楙字子林，是夏侯惇的次子，早已因自身功勞封爲列侯。",
            "zhs": "夏侯楙字子林，是夏侯惇的次子，早已因自身功劳封为列侯。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "曹操（孟德）",
      "to": "清河公主",
      "type": "kinship",
      "polarity": "neutral",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "The Princess of Qinghe was Cao Cao's daughter, whom he married to Xiahou Mao.",
            "zht": "清河公主是曹操的女兒，曹操把她嫁給了夏侯楙。",
            "zhs": "清河公主是曹操的女儿，曹操把她嫁给了夏侯楙。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "夏侯楙（子林）",
      "to": "清河公主",
      "type": "kinship",
      "polarity": "neutral",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "Cao Cao married his daughter, the Princess of Qinghe, to Xiahou Mao; because Xiahou Mao kept many concubines in the west, the couple fell out, and his brothers later had the princess submit their slander against him.",
            "zht": "曹操把女兒清河公主嫁給夏侯楙；夏侯楙在西方時蓄養了許多伎妾，公主因此與他不和，後來他的弟弟們還讓公主出面上奏誹謗他。",
            "zhs": "曹操把女儿清河公主嫁给夏侯楙；夏侯楙在西方时蓄养了许多伎妾，公主因此与他不和，后来他的弟弟们还让公主出面上奏诽谤他。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "曹丕（子桓）",
      "to": "夏侯楙（子林）",
      "type": "personal",
      "polarity": "positive",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "Cao Pi had been close to Xiahou Mao since their youth.",
            "zht": "曹丕年少時就與夏侯楙親近。",
            "zhs": "曹丕年少时就与夏侯楙亲近。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "夏侯楙（子林）",
      "to": "曹丕（子桓）",
      "type": "service",
      "polarity": "positive",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "On ascending the throne, Cao Pi made Xiahou Mao General Who Pacifies the West with the Imperial Tally, succeeding Xiahou Yuan in command of Guanzhong, though he had no military talent.",
            "zht": "曹丕即位後，任命夏侯楙爲安西將軍，持節，接替夏侯淵都督關中；但夏侯楙並無武略。",
            "zhs": "曹丕即位后，任命夏侯楙为安西将军，持节，接替夏侯渊都督关中；但夏侯楙并无武略。"
          },
          "title": {
            "en": "General Who Pacifies the West",
            "zht": "安西將軍",
            "zhs": "安西将军"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "夏侯楙（子林）",
      "to": "曹叡（元仲）",
      "type": "service",
      "polarity": "positive",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "When Cao Rui campaigned west in the second year of Taihe and Xiahou Mao was reported on, he recalled him to serve in the Imperial Secretariat.",
            "zht": "太和二年明帝西征，有人告發夏侯楙，明帝召他回朝任尚書。",
            "zhs": "太和二年明帝西征，有人告发夏侯楙，明帝召他回朝任尚书。"
          },
          "title": {
            "en": "Imperial Secretariat",
            "zht": "尚書",
            "zhs": "尚书"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "曹叡（元仲）",
      "to": "夏侯楙（子林）",
      "type": "personal",
      "polarity": "negative",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "Cao Rui had Xiahou Mao arrested over a slanderous memorial and meant to put him to death, but after hearing Duan Mo he ordered an inquiry that exposed Mao's brothers as its authors.",
            "zht": "明帝因誹謗的奏章下詔逮捕夏侯楙，本想殺他；聽了段默的意見後，下詔追查，查明是夏侯楙的弟弟們捏造的。",
            "zhs": "明帝因诽谤的奏章下诏逮捕夏侯楙，本想杀他；听了段默的意见后，下诏追查，查明是夏侯楙的弟弟们捏造的。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "段默",
      "to": "曹叡（元仲）",
      "type": "service",
      "polarity": "positive",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "As Colonel of the Changshui Garrison, Duan Mo was consulted by Cao Rui on whether to execute Xiahou Mao, and Cao Rui accepted his view.",
            "zht": "長水校尉段默受明帝詢問是否該殺夏侯楙，明帝採納了他的意見。",
            "zhs": "长水校尉段默受明帝询问是否该杀夏侯楙，明帝采纳了他的意见。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "段默",
      "to": "夏侯楙（子林）",
      "type": "personal",
      "polarity": "positive",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "Duan Mo argued that the charges against Xiahou Mao arose from the princess's quarrel with him, and urged mercy in light of his father's part in founding the realm, saving his life.",
            "zht": "段默認爲指控夏侯楙的言辭出於公主與他不和而生的誣陷，又念及其父有平定天下之功，請明帝三思，夏侯楙因此得免。",
            "zhs": "段默认为指控夏侯楙的言辞出于公主与他不和而生的诬陷，又念及其父有平定天下之功，请明帝三思，夏侯楙因此得免。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "夏侯楙（子林）",
      "to": "夏侯子臧",
      "type": "kinship",
      "polarity": "neutral",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "Zizang was one of Xiahou Mao's younger brothers, whom Mao repeatedly rebuked for disregarding propriety.",
            "zht": "子臧是夏侯楙的弟弟之一，夏侯楙曾多次責備他們不守禮法。",
            "zhs": "子臧是夏侯楙的弟弟之一，夏侯楙曾多次责备他们不守礼法。"
          }
        }
      ]
