      "type": "personal",
      "polarity": "negative",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9a-p5",
          "text": {
            "en": "Fearing punishment after Xiahou Mao's rebukes, Zizang and Zijiang fabricated slander against him and had the princess submit it; Cao Rui's inquiry exposed them.",
            "zht": "子臧、子江害怕被夏侯楙懲治，便共同捏造誹謗之辭，讓公主上奏；明帝追查後，真相大白。",
            "zhs": "子臧、子江害怕被夏侯楙惩治，便共同捏造诽谤之辞，让公主上奏；明帝追查后，真相大白。"
